        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><em>This Schedule is incorporated by reference into each of the documents identified in the Purpose and Scope section. A User's acceptance of any User Agreement that incorporates this Schedule constitutes acceptance of this Schedule, in the version that applies to that User under the Purpose and Scope section.</em></p>

